    "description": "<p>During a moment of calm, make a <strong>Spellcast Roll (13)</strong>. Once per rest on a success, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to step beyond the veil of death and converse with any nearby spirits. Place a number of tokens equal to your Spellcast trait on this card and remove one each time a spirit answers a question. When the last token is removed or at the end of the scene, you return to the Mortal Realm in the same spot you left it.</p>",
